        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST ONE BEDROOM / ONE BATHROOM APARTMENT, SOUTH CIRCULAR ROAD, DUBLIN 08, LOCATION AVAILABLE NOW RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this one-bedroom / one-bathroom property to the rental market in Dublin, South Circular Road. This recently renovated property is well presented throughout and offers comfortable modern living in an excellent and well-established residential setting. Ideally located and within reach to Dublin City Center!! Dublin Bus stop is just outside, 2 min walk (bus routes 68/68A/73), along with a host of local amenities including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. Café Shop (4min walk), Natural Bakery (3 min), Mace (7min walk), Spar (3 min walk), Supervalu (15min walk). Gym (15 min walk).\n\n\nThe property also benefits from excellent and easy access transport links with the Dublin Bus, Luas Stop and Heuston Station. Internal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, open space kitchen and dining area, Spacious Living Room, Large Double Bedroom. Available now and viewing is highly advised. Features:\n\n1 bedroom / 1 bathroom house.\n\nRecently Renovated.\n\nFully fitted kitchen.\n\nGas Heating.\n\nA host of local amenities nearby. (Cafés, Herberton Gym, Mace, Supervalu, Spar, Bakery)\n\nHighly Sought after location. (close to CityCenter, Heuston Train Station, Luas stop, Dublin Bus-Stop (3min walk), St. James's Hospital nearby.)\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
